<title>FRENCH GUIANA: Port conditions update - French Guiana - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - French Guiana - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>CAYENNE, Sept 11 - Because of a strike of road carriers, the port of Degrad des Cannes has not been available since Sept 9. Vessels in port not discharged. LPG carrier Cervantes arrived today, for which discharging of gas is possible.</p>
</text>
